<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MBNA upgraded to strong buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MBNA upgraded to strong buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it raised its recommendation on MBNA Corp to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Mark Alpert was not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- MBNA shares were up one to 35-7/8 in early New York Stock Exchange trading.</p>
